config DILEMMA_STATE_SYNC
    bool "Sync modifier state from central to peripheral"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_SPLIT
    help
      Forwards the held-modifier byte to the peripheral as invocations of
      the state_sync behavior, for the peripheral's screen to display.
